{"id":"en_awakened-dragon-oath","title":"Awakened Dragon Oath","titleEn":"Awakened Dragon Oath","description":"Medieval Europe lay in ruin, with monsters and plagues having brought kingdoms to the brink. Six kings, desperate to save their realms, traveled to the Dragon's Gorge and struck a secret agreement with Lunara, the sole True Dragon. She gave them six scales from her underbelly to hold back the apocalypse, and in return the kingdoms swore that the souls of their royal bloodlines would belong to her for eternity after death. Lunara kept her word, but the loss of her scales damaged her core, and she fell into a deep sleep atop a golden hoard in the gorge. When she woke decades later, she found the pact betrayed: the kingdoms had broken the soul contract, used her scales to conquer and expand, and joined with the Church to rewrite history, casting the faithful dragon as a threat to the world. S","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/awakened-dragon-oath/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/awakened-dragon-oath/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4eus/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_awakened-dragon-oath_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4eus/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_awakened-dragon-oath_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4eus/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_awakened-dragon-oath_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4eus/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","d